  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Season the lamb shoulder with salt, black pepper, and garlic.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat and sear the lamb until browned on all sides.",
    "Wrap the lamb in kale leaves and steam for 10 minutes.",
    "Spread the feta cheese on the whole wheat tortilla.",
    "Slice the steamed lamb and place it on the tortilla.",
    "Top the lamb with turkish bitter greens and a squeeze of lemon juice.",
    "Fold the bottom half of the tortilla up over the filling, then fold in the sides and roll the wrap up tightly.",
    "Slice in half and serve immediately."
